below editor** \u2014 nested \u0060ResizableContainer\u0060 with vertical direction\n- **File-tree sidebar** \u2014 follows terminal\u0027s OSC 7-reported cwd\n- **Settings modal** \u2014 for configuring the Albert API key\n- **Decorative overlay image** \u2014 Unsplash background at 35% opacity\n\n### Tests\nA comprehensive \u0060#[cfg(test)]\u0060 module covering:\n- \u0060should_send_message()\u0060 edge cases\n- Language detection (all 10 languages, case-insensitivity, defaults)\n- File extensions and derived file names\n- Run commands for each language\n\nThe file is well-structured and complete. Is there anything specific you\u0027d like me to check, modify, or explain about it?",
